# Tasks - Scenario 2

## Backend - Game Start Logic
- [x] Add `playing` to `RoomStatus` in `backend/src/models/game.ts`.
- [x] Add `drawerId` and `secretWord` to `Room` interface.
- [x] Add `secretWord` and `isDrawer` to `RoomSnapshot` interface.
- [x] Implement `startGame(code: string, participantId: string)` in `backend/src/services/roomStore.ts`.
  - [x] Validate participant is host.
  - [x] Set status to `playing`.
  - [x] Assign `drawerId` (first participant).
  - [x] Select `secretWord` (deterministic).
