- [x] Add `POST /rooms/:code/start` in `backend/src/api/rooms.ts`.

## Frontend - Game Transition & Role UI
- [x] Update `RoomSnapshot` and `api` service in `frontend/src/services/api.ts`.
- [x] Implement `startGame` in `frontend/src/state/roomStore.ts`.
- [x] In `LobbyPage.tsx`, detect `status === 'playing'` in the polling loop and redirect to `/game`.
- [x] In `LobbyPage.tsx`, hook up "Start Game" button to `roomStore.startGame()`.
- [x] Update `GamePage.tsx` to display the secret word if `room.isDrawer` is true.
