## Validation
- [x] Verify game starts only when host clicks "Start Game" and ≥2 players are present.
- [x] Verify all players are redirected to `/game` via polling.
- [x] Verify the drawer sees the secret word.
- [x] Verify guessers do NOT see the secret word.
- [x] Verify player names are trimmed and validated on join/create.
